                                Table "public.books"
     Column     |  Type   | Collation | Nullable |             Default              
----------------+---------+-----------+----------+----------------------------------
 book_id        | integer |           | not null | generated by default as identity
 title          | text    |           | not null | 
 author         | text    |           | not null | 
 category       | text    |           | not null | 
 price          | integer |           | not null | 
 page_count     | integer |           | not null | 
 published_date | date    |           | not null | 
 stock          | integer |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "books_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (book_id)
Check constraints:
    "books_page_count_check" CHECK (page_count > 0)
    "books_price_check" CHECK (price > 0)
    "books_stock_check" CHECK (stock >= 0)
Referenced by:
    TABLE "order_items" CONSTRAINT "order_items_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
    TABLE "reviews" CONSTRAINT "reviews_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
